sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Agent as Camera Agent
    participant LogicHost
    participant Entra as Azure Entra (Tenant)

    rect rgb(230,240,255)
    Agent->>Agent: Load CentralIdentityOptions (ServiceUrl, Mode)
    Agent->>Entra: Client credentials request (client_id, secret, scopes)
    Entra-->>Agent: Access token (expires_in ~300s)
    end

    Agent->>LogicHost: API call with Bearer token (SkyMonitor.Api HttpClient)
    LogicHost->>LogicHost: Validate issuer (Entra) & scopes (api.camera,...)
    LogicHost-->>Agent: Response (frames/telemetry/etc.)

    rect rgb(255,240,230)
    Agent->>Agent: Local admin fallback configured? (Mode=ApiKey)
    Agent-->>LogicHost: API call with X-API-Key header
    LogicHost->>LogicHost: Hash compare & issue claims (local issuer)
    LogicHost-->>Agent: Response
    end

    Note over Agent,LogicHost: Interactive operators use cookie + OIDC redirect (same Entra tenant) for UI login/logout.
